OL,3,GNEWSAGas starts flowing from Jackdaw
OL,4,Aafter government green light
OL,5,
OL,6,FGas has begun flowing from the Jackdaw
OL,7,Fgas field, with the UK energy secretary
OL,8,Fsaying it will help to heat millions of
OL,9,Fhomes and businesses this winter.
OL,11,FMinisters last month announced the
OL,12,FJackdaw field, which lies 150 miles
OL,13,Feast of Aberdeen, had been approved
OL,14,Fafter years of uncertainty and a court
OL,15,Fcase.
OL,17,FIt has now been announced that it has
OL,18,Fbegun producing gas which will start
OL,19,Fflowing into Britain, according to its
OL,20,Foperator Adura.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
