OL,3,GNEWSAGas starts flowing from Jackdaw
OL,4,Aafter government green light
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government approved production
OL,7,Ffrom the gas field in the North Sea
OL,8,Flast month, amid intense debate about
OL,9,Fthe project's environmental and
OL,10,Feconomic impact.
